    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/ce58d91afe22ae78e84a5139f11e943d.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" width=800 height=123 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/ce58d91afe22ae78e84a5139f11e943d.webm?t=1753735073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/7ef54d9f816c2537309aadc0c01a5b7d.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/7ef54d9f816c2537309aadc0c01a5b7d.webp?t=1753735073\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=50 /></picture></span><strong>Procedural Map Generation -</strong> each time you join an online game or start a new campaign, brand new maps are created so that your experience is always unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/5ba707a9ad5213fac5d28f6fb6164ba9.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/5ba707a9ad5213fac5d28f6fb6164ba9.apng?t=1753735073\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=50 /></picture></span><strong>Deckbuilding -</strong> Summon Undead, create a Black Hole, or drop a Nuke, use your best cards to achieve victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/7242308d6682ad062751565e4617e2eb.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/7242308d6682ad062751565e4617e2eb.apng?t=1753735073\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=50 /></picture></span><strong>Army Building -</strong> choose from various units ranging from rats up to High-tech pandas to build an undefeatable army. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/0aa66b80a22135b0098d2bc3f00ea5a3.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/0aa66b80a22135b0098d2bc3f00ea5a3.webp?t=1753735073\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=50 /></picture></span><strong>Interactable Maps -</strong> throw your enemies into holes, hit explosive barrels, or trigger wasp hives to annihilate your enemies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/b8495a38109cd30356fc332e705bcd5d.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/b8495a38109cd30356fc332e705bcd5d.webm?t=1753735073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/b8495a38109cd30356fc332e705bcd5d.mp4?t=1753735073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/7760fff46ac465efd384948d5ea97d7d.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/7760fff46ac465efd384948d5ea97d7d.apng?t=1753735073\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=50 /></picture></span><strong>Solo Campaign</strong>, play alone in the campaign mode to conquer the world and regain the original sheep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/2b2dea3a9c8497812bd49b5103ad9f3b.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/2b2dea3a9c8497812bd49b5103ad9f3b.webp?t=1753735073\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=50 /></picture></span><strong>Online Multiplayer - J</strong>oin an online multiplayer match to fight and defeat other Sheeple (no limit on player count)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/5847ab950772c1aa493916190714ebe7.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/5847ab950772c1aa493916190714ebe7.apng?t=1753735073\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=50 /></picture></span><strong>Infinite Local Multiplayer - </strong>Split your screen as many times as you want! There is a recommended number, but I won't stop you from testing your PC! Play battles with as many friends as you want! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/797093aea7be4f49e189d0c952b4c282.poster.avif?t=1753735073\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/797093aea7be4f49e189d0c952b4c282.apng?t=1753735073\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=50 /></picture></span><strong>Online Local Multiplaye</strong>r - Join online games with your local players. You ca